; Shared COMPACT font, 42 glyphs: DIGIT0..9, LETTER_A..Z, then DASH EXCLAM DOT COLON QUESTION SLASH.
; Drop-in for font.tiles: same labels, same tile order (code indexes FONT_MINI_DIGIT0 + d and
; FONT_MINI_LETTER_A + (c - 'A')): never insert or reorder tiles.
; Use with "common_res": ["font_mini", "font_mini_lower", "font_mini_es"] -> #include "font_mini.h".
; Proposal for games/mazmorra (comparison: games/mazmorra/design/font_compare.png); not adopted yet.
;
; PROPORTIONAL font for the engine's variable-width renderer (gbe_vwf): every glyph is LEFT-ALIGNED
; (column 0 = first ink column) with no built-in spacing; width = last ink column + 1; the renderer
; adds 1 px between letters. SPACE = 5th tile of font_mini_es.tiles (blank), width 3.
; Design rules (bold compact: GDD 5.3 + the user's dislike of thin 1 px fonts):
; - Same weight as font.tiles (2 px vertical stems, 1 px bars) in a smaller body.
; - Cap height 6 px on rows 1-6 (row 0 = 1 px leading above), baseline row 6; row 7 empty except
;   lowercase descenders and the comma: 3 lines stacked every 8 px never touch.
; - Widths: most letters 6 px, M W 7, I 4; digits 6 (0 is 5 vs O 6, 1 is 3); ! . : ' 2 px.
; Generated by a scratch script; this file is the source of truth now.

